      "description": {
        "fun": "When Burmy evolves, its cloak fuses with its body, so Wormadam is stuck with whatever it was wearing, leaves, sand or rubbish, for life. Each cloak gives it a different second type: Grass, Ground or Steel. Its antenna and bag may nod to Baba Yaga, the Slavic witch who flies in a mortar with a pestle and broom, and its name is simply bagworm plus madam.",
        "guide": "Wormadam is the female-only evolution of Burmy. Its cloak, set by the one Burmy wore when it evolved, becomes part of its body: Plant Cloak (Bug and Grass), Sandy Cloak (Bug and Ground) or Trash Cloak (Bug and Steel).",
        "tagline": "A bagworm madam who wears her cloak for life.",
        "sources": [
          {
            "title": "Bulbapedia: Wormadam (Pokémon)",
            "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Wormadam_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"
          }
