      },
      "description": {
        "fun": "Mothim loves flower honey but won't gather any itself. Instead it flutters about at night and raids Combee hives, which is why it's never seen around flower gardens. Its name mixes moth with him, fitting the male-only partner of Wormadam, and may hide 'nim', slang for stealing; its Japanese name Gamale sounds like gameru, 'to pilfer'.",
        "guide": "Mothim is the male-only evolution of Burmy, a Bug- and Flying-type moth. It has no nest and roams fields and mountains in search of nectar, often stealing honey from Combee. Its female counterpart is Wormadam.",
        "tagline": "A honey thief that lets the Combee do all the work.",
        "sources": [
          {
            "title": "Bulbapedia: Mothim (Pokémon)",
            "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Mothim_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"
          }
        ]
      },
